<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIAN BOURSE STATISTICS MARCH 17-21.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIAN BOURSE STATISTICS MARCH 17-21.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The capitalisation of the</p>
<p>Vilnius bourse rose to 5.75 billion litas last week versus 5.63</p>
<p>billion litas a week earlier, the National stock exchange said</p>
<p>on Monday.</p>
<p>The statistics of Vilnius bourse:</p>
<p>					     March 17-21   March 12-14</p>
<p>    Submitted orders		   13,983	  7,246</p>
<p>    Executed orders		    1,649	   1,366</p>
<p>Number of transaction on</p>
<p>    central market (CM)		1,525	   1,248</p>
<p>    Turnover on the CM in LTL	7,917,320     6,896,750</p>
<p>Number of transactions in</p>
<p>    bloc trades (BT)		   62		59</p>
<p>    Turnover of BT in LTL	    3,381,340     6,366,840</p>
<p>    Supply of shares per week	37,747,636    24,361,656</p>
<p>    Demand of shares per week	3,620,148     3,427,439</p>
<p>Turnover of shares</p>
<p>    on CM per week in LTL	    6,807,390     6,775,650</p>
<p>    in BT per week in LTL	    3,381,340     6,366,840</p>
<p>The number of transactions</p>
<p>    in government T bills	    10		4</p>
<p>The turnover of government</p>
<p>    T bills in LTL per week	  1,109,920     121,000</p>
<p>--Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom + 370 2 22 35 17</p>
</text>
